		(property "Description" "Car-rail sense: OUT high (BACKUP_REQ) once the rail is below 9.66 V, low again above ~10.2 V. Nanopower comparator with 1.242 V +/-1% reference, 1.8-5.5 V supply so it runs straight from the cell, 2.8 uA typical, push-pull output, inputs to the rails. -40..+125 C. SOT-23-6 (tracker-style jellybean, 10k+ in stock)"
